#: ../../slither.md:8
msgid "Slither"
msgstr ""

#: ../../slither.md:10
msgid "[Slither](https://github.com/crytic/slither) is a static analysis framework for Solidity. It runs a suite of vulnerability detectors and provides information about contract details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../slither.md:12
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../slither.md:14
msgid "To use Slither analysis with Remix IDE efficiently, the following tools should be installed locally on your system:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../slither.md:16
msgid "**Slither:** [Installing Slither](https://crytic.github.io/slither/slither.html#how-to-install)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../slither.md:17
msgid "**Solc:** [Installing Solidity](https://docs.soliditylang.org/en/latest/installing-solidity.html)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../slither.md:18
msgid "**Solc-select:** [Solc Quickstart](https://github.com/crytic/solc-select#quickstart)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../slither.md:20
msgid "How to use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../slither.md:22
msgid "Slither analysis is available in Remix Desktop through the `Solidity Static Analysis` plugin and on Remix Web through RemixAI."
msgstr ""

